**Changes**
- **`src/services/holidays.ts` (new):** a hardcoded list of the 13 nationwide holidays for each of 2026 and 2027, plus an `isPublicHoliday(date)` helper. It works fully offline. Easter Monday, Ascension, Whit Monday and Corpus Christi are worked out from Easter (5 April 2026, 28 March 2027) and written in as plain dates.
- **`src/services/eta.ts`:** `isBusinessDay` now also returns false on a holiday. `addBusinessDays` and `calculateEta` use it, so I changed nothing else.
- **`test/holidays.test.ts` (new):** 13 tests covering:
  - holiday lookups and the shape of the list;
  - skipping a holiday in the middle of a date range;
  - Easter Monday 2026;
  - Christmas plus the weekend after it;
  - the New Year and Epiphany span across the year boundary;
  - Corpus Christi 2027;
  - a pickup that falls on a holiday;
  - exception delays that cross a holiday.

